  "description": "*Reply by email only* \n\nHopkins Ward are excited about launching 57 bath avenue to the rental market. The building has undergone a complete refurbishment project and now incorporates 6 X LUXURY APARTMENTS. We have 5 x 1 bedroom apartments and 1 x 2 bedroom apartment. Each Apt has been decorated and presented to the highest of standards. One of the many unique selling points is that each of the apartments have reached a 'B' RATING ON THE BER SCALE. To achieve B rating for multi units apartments is a testament to the refurbishment and use of materials. In showing a 'Green Pathway' to refurbishment, the developer installed solar panels to each of the units and the individual tenants will benefit from lower running costs. Being a first let this stunning 1 bedroom apartment is a must see. 2 of the ground floor 1 beds, have the benefit of PRIVATE GARDEN AREAS. High end kitchens, modern bathrooms, luxury bedrooms all point to high end living in Dublin 4. Each apartment has been thoughtfully laid out and designed. A number of the ground floor apartments have private garden spaces. The entire building benefits from a beautifully manicured communal rear garden. Viewings are a must via the letting team at Hopkins Ward Estate Agents",
